# This repo is built on Windows and runs in a Linux container. core.autocrlf
# would hand a fresh clone CRLF line endings, and a shell script whose shebang
# ends in \r fails inside Docker with a "not found" that names the interpreter
# that plainly exists. Pin the files the image executes to LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to normalise them.
*.png binary
*.db binary
